<section class="hero grad"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="/index.html">Home</a> › Portfolio</div><div class="eyebrow">Our Work</div><h1>Projects Across Northwest Arkansas</h1><p>From historic homes to landmark commercial spaces, including the Bentonville Tiger stadium and the Walmart campus bike mural, here's a look at the quality we bring to every job.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="tel:+14796404675">Start Your Project <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a></div></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="chips" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:40px"><span class="chip" style="cursor:default">🏈 Bentonville Tiger Stadium</span><span class="chip" style="cursor:default">🚲 Walmart Campus Bike Mural</span><span class="chip" style="cursor:default">🏢 8th Street Market</span><span class="chip" style="cursor:default">🛒 Sam's Club</span><span class="chip" style="cursor:default">🏠 100s of Homes</span></div>
<div class="grid g3">
{%- for item in collections.projects | reverse %}
{%- set alt = item.data.imageAlt or (item.data.title + " by Liberty Painting Specialists") %}
<figure class="card" style="margin:0">
{%- if item.data.beforePhoto %}
<div class="ba" style="border-radius:0;box-shadow:none"><img src="{{ item.data.photo }}" alt="After: {{ alt }}"><img class="ba-before" src="{{ item.data.beforePhoto }}" alt="Before: {{ alt }}"><div class="ba-div"><span class="ba-grip">&#9664;&#9654;</span></div><input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Drag to compare before and after"><span class="ba-tag ba-tag-l">Before</span><span class="ba-tag ba-tag-r">After</span></div>
{%- else %}
<img src="{{ item.data.photo }}" alt="{{ alt }}" loading="lazy">
{%- endif %}
<figcaption class="body"><h3 class="sub" style="color:#0d1b2e;font-size:20px">{{ item.data.title }}</h3>{% if item.data.location %}<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#6a7385">{{ item.data.location }}</p>{% endif %}{% if item.data.details %}<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;color:#3a4456;line-height:1.55">{{ item.data.details }}</p>{% endif %}</figcaption>
</figure>
{%- endfor %}
